.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH daktilo 1  "daktilo 0.6.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
daktilo \- Turn your keyboard into a typewriter! 📇
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdaktilo\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-preset\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-list\-presets\fR] [\fB\-\-list\-devices\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-init\fR] [\fB\-\-variate\-volume\fR] [\fB\-\-variate\-tempo\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Turn your keyboard into a typewriter! 📇
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose logging
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-preset\fR=\fIPRESET\fR
Sets the name of the sound preset to use.

Can be specified multiple times to play multiple presets at once.
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBPRESET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-list\-presets\fR
Lists the available presets
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-devices\fR
Lists the available output devices
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-device\fR=\fIDEVICE\fR
Sets the device for playback
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBDAKTILO_DEVICE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR=\fIPATH\fR
Sets the configuration file
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBDAKTILO_CONFIG\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-init\fR
Writes the default configuration file
.TP
\fB\-\-variate\-volume\fR=\fIPERCENT_UP[,PERCENT_DOWN]\fR
Variate volume +/\- in percent
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBDAKTILO_VOLUME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-variate\-tempo\fR=\fIPERCENT_UP[,PERCENT_DOWN]\fR
Variate tempo +/\- in percent
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBDAKTILO_TEMPO\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.6.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
